The rope and bucket are now lost in the bottom of the well.	繩子和水桶已經掉進井底，再也拿不回來了。
The rope is now lost in the bottom of the well.	繩子已經掉進井底，再也拿不回來了。
You cut the bucket off of the rope.	你把水桶從繩子上割了下來。
This side of the well is crumbling to pieces.  Try the other side.	井的這一側正在崩塌碎裂，試試另一側吧。
You can't do that when you are invisible!	你隱形的時候沒辦法這麼做！
The old bucket is at the bottom of the well.	那個舊水桶在井底。
You will find that very difficult to do from here.	你會發現從這裡很難做到這件事。
You are in a clearing in the forest.  You have the uneasy feeling that someone or something is watching you.	你身處森林中的一片空地，隱約感覺有什麼人或什麼東西正在注視著你。
You don't see a wolf here.	這裡沒有看到狼。
By the time you got out your slingshot and pebbles, and aimed them, the wolf would be upon you!	等你拿出投石器和鵝卵石瞄準好，狼早就撲到你身上了！
You have nothing with which to shoot the wolf...and even if you did, you probably couldn't.	你手邊沒有能拿來射狼的東西……就算有，你恐怕也做不到。
You'd need some sort of ammunition to even attempt such an inadvisable feat.	就算想嘗試這種不智之舉，你也得先有某種彈藥才行。
You're not talking about shooting yourself, are you?	你該不會是想射自己吧？
You have neither projectiles nor the means with which to propel them, should you want to attempt such a folly.	就算你真想做這種蠢事，你既沒有彈藥，也沒有發射彈藥的工具。
You could scarcely hope to bother the wolf by tossing pebbles at it!	光丟幾顆鵝卵石，你根本別想騷擾得了那隻狼！
There's nothing interesting to throw your pebbles at here.	這裡沒有什麼有趣的東西值得你拿鵝卵石丟。
You don't have any pebbles to throw.	你身上沒有鵝卵石可以丟。
The wolf's muscles are coiled steel springs. His massive jaws, razor-sharp teeth and long, wicked claws are a deadly blur. And you want to try to kill him? Better think again!	那隻狼渾身肌肉猶如盤緊的鋼製彈簧。牠碩大的下顎、剃刀般鋒利的牙齒，還有又長又凶惡的爪子，快得幾乎讓人看不清。你竟然想殺了牠？你最好再想想！
The wolf's muscles are coiled steel springs. His massive jaws, razor-sharp teeth and long, wicked claws are deadly blur. And you want to get him? Better think again!	那隻狼渾身肌肉猶如盤緊的鋼製彈簧。牠碩大的下顎、剃刀般鋒利的牙齒，還有又長又凶惡的爪子，快得幾乎讓人看不清。你竟然想抓住牠？你最好再想想！
He's too lean and wiry to make a good meal. But he'll make a good meal out of you if you don't run!	牠瘦巴巴、精實得很，當不了一頓好料理。但你要是不快跑，你倒會變成牠的美餐！
You'll be riding inside the wolf if you stand here.	你要是站在這裡不動，就會被狼一口吞進肚子裡。
It looks like the wolf has his stomach set on you.  Spend less time looking and more time escaping!	看樣子那隻狼盯上你的肚子了。別光顧著看，快逃命吧！
Without warning,  a wolf darts out of the bushes and runs straight for you.  Look out!   Don't let him catch you.	毫無預警，一隻狼從灌木叢中竄出，直朝你衝來。小心！別讓牠追上你。
Even your invisibility didn't hide you from the wolf's keen sense of smell.	就連隱形都瞞不過那隻狼靈敏的嗅覺。
There is an enormous oak tree growing here, its branches reaching up to the sky.	這裡長著一棵巨大的橡樹，枝椏直探天際。
You can't do that when you're invisible.	你隱形的時候沒辦法這麼做。
The old goat is afraid of heights and refuses to climb the tree.	那隻老山羊有懼高症，不肯爬樹。
Finding plenty of footholds in the coarse bark of the tree, you easily clamber up the trunk to the branches above.	樹皮粗糙、踩點很多，你輕鬆地攀著樹幹爬上了上方的枝椏。
You're too busy right now to climb a tree.	你現在正忙著別的事，沒空爬樹。
You can't climb a tree from here!	你在這裡沒辦法爬樹！
From here, you can see the battlements of King Edward's castle overlooking the garden.	從這裡，你可以看見愛德華國王城堡的城垛，俯瞰著這座花園。
Unfortunately, drowning in the lake is occupying all of your attention.	很不巧，你正忙著在湖裡溺水，沒空分心。
You are already swimming.	你已經在游泳了。
You have to be in the water to go swimming.	你得先在水裡才能游泳。
There are strong currents under the calm surface of this lake.  Diving here would be too dangerous.	這片湖面平靜，水下卻暗藏強勁的水流，在這裡潛水太危險了。
That's a dangerous proposition from here.	從這裡做這件事太危險了。
The bucket is already full of water.	水桶已經裝滿水了。
With difficulty, you fill the bucket while swimming.	你費了好大功夫，總算在游泳時把水桶裝滿了水。
You kneel down and fill the bucket with the cool water.	你跪下身，把水桶裝滿了清涼的湖水。
You do not have a bucket to put the water in.	你身上沒有水桶可以裝水。
There is no safe place from which to get a drink of water.	這裡沒有安全的地方可以喝水。
Wandering along the banks of a beautiful lake, you see a cute little elf.	你沿著這座美麗湖泊的岸邊漫步，看見一個可愛的小精靈。
Lush pine trees ring the lake.	茂密的松樹環繞著這座湖。
On this side of the lake, the banks of the lake are low and rocky.	湖的這一側岸邊低矮，遍布岩石。
The mountain is much too steep and rocky for you to climb.	這座山又陡又多岩石，你爬不上去。
Since you were not very polite to the elf, he has departed.	由於你對小精靈不太禮貌，牠已經離開了。
This particular elf doesn't care for close physical contact with strangers.	這個小精靈不喜歡和陌生人有肢體接觸。
The elf has done nothing to you.  Why hurt him?	小精靈根本沒對你做什麼，你為什麼要傷害牠？
There is no elf here.	這裡沒有小精靈。
There is a very pretty lake here; a small elf is wandering up and down the shore.	這裡有一座非常漂亮的湖泊，一個小精靈正沿著湖岸來回徘徊。
This is a clear mountain lake with some low and rocky banks surrounding it.	這是一座清澈的山中湖泊，周圍環繞著低矮多岩的湖岸。
You came too close to the shy little elf.	你靠這隻害羞的小精靈太近了。
The small elf seems friendly enough.	這個小精靈看起來還算友善。
Silly!  You can't get close enough to do that.	傻瓜！你根本沒辦法靠得夠近做這件事。
I'm surprised at you!  That is very impolite!	真讓我意外！這樣做太沒禮貌了！
You don't have anything to throw.	你身上沒有東西可以丟。
You should get closer to the little elf.	你應該靠近這隻小精靈一點。
There's no need to do that to the elf.	沒必要對這隻小精靈做這種事。
The elf is impressed by your friendliness and responds by handing you an elegant little ring.	小精靈被你的友善打動，回贈了你一枚精緻小巧的戒指。
ELF:  "I've had my eye on ye, Sir Graham.  Methinks you might enjoy this little trinket.  For just a wee bit o' time, it has the power to make ye invisible."	ELF:「我一直在留意你呢，格拉漢爵士。我猜你會喜歡這個小玩意兒——它能讓你在短時間內隱形。」
ELF:  "May it give ye as much entertainment as ye has given me this day!	ELF:「願它能像你今天帶給我的樂趣一樣，也帶給你同樣多的樂趣！
With that, the elf vanishes.	說完，小精靈就消失了。
Curiously, a large door has been built into the steep mountainside.	說也奇怪，陡峭的山壁上竟建了一扇大門。
It's a gold lock.  Coincidentally, you have a gold key.	這是一把金鎖。真巧，你身上正好有一把金鑰匙。
It's a gold lock.  Somewhere, there is a key that fits this lock.	這是一把金鎖。在某個地方，有把鑰匙能打開它。
There are many scattered pines around here.	這附近散布著許多松樹。
has:	擁有：
Just use your gold key to unlock the door.	只要用你的金鑰匙打開這扇門就行了。
Perhaps if you'd attended the Famous Adventurer's Correspondence School, you'd know how to pick locks. Sadly, you don't.	也許你上過「知名冒險家函授學校」的話，就會撬鎖了。可惜你沒上過。
Move closer to the door.	走近門一點。
You strike the door with all your might!   Unfortunately, the door doesn't give an inch.	你使出全身力氣猛擊那扇門！可惜，門紋絲不動。
It will be difficult to do that from here.	從這裡做這件事會很困難。
Move a little closer to the door.	再靠近門一點。
The door appears to be already open.	這扇門看起來已經開著了。
Using the gold key, you unlock the huge door...	你用金鑰匙打開了這扇巨大的門……
The huge door is locked.  You can't open it.	這扇巨大的門鎖著，你打不開。
How do you want to use the key?	你想怎麼使用這把鑰匙？
Wishing you had a key doesn't make it so, Sir Graham.	格拉漢爵士，光是希望有鑰匙，並不會讓鑰匙憑空出現。
You can't unlock the door without a key.	沒有鑰匙，你打不開這扇門。
This massive door is securely locked.	這扇巨大的門鎖得很牢固。
Through the keyhole you can dimly see a staircase.  It looks like it might go up into the mountain.	透過鑰匙孔，你隱約看見一座階梯，看起來似乎通往山的內部。
You need to get closer to the door's keyhole	你得靠近門上的鑰匙孔一點。
A huge wooden door has been built into the base of a steep mountain.  You notice a large keyhole in the door.	陡峭山腳下建了一扇巨大的木門，你注意到門上有個大大的鑰匙孔。
Don't be afraid.  Get close enough for a good look.	別害怕，靠近一點好好看清楚。
The only response you get is the echo of your pounding.	你得到的唯一回應，只有自己敲門聲的回音。
Wait for the goat while it tries to catch up.	等等那隻山羊，讓牠跟上來。
There are no beavers here now.	這裡現在沒有海狸。
This is a pretty little alpine lake.  There is a cool breeze here, and the lake shimmers softly in the quiet mountain air.	這是一座美麗的高山小湖，這裡涼風徐徐，湖面在寧靜的山間空氣中輕輕閃爍著光芒。
It looks as though there were beavers around here at one time.	看起來這一帶似乎曾經有過海狸。
Sunlight glistens on the rippling lake water.	陽光在盪漾的湖水上閃閃發光。
The fish are pretty jumpy in Daventry, aren't they?	戴凡確王國的魚還真是活蹦亂跳，不是嗎？
There aren't any fish here to see...at the moment.	現在這裡……暫時看不到任何魚。
There's no witch here at the moment.	現在這裡沒有巫婆。
This part of the forest is dark and creepy.  Shadows seem to jump out at you, and the trees are gnarled and misshapen.	這一帶的森林陰暗又詭異，陰影彷彿隨時會朝你撲來，樹木也扭曲變形、奇形怪狀。
This is not your friendly-type witch.	這可不是那種友善的巫婆。
Killing the witch would be very difficult right now, she is moving too fast!	現在要殺死這個巫婆很困難，她動作快得很！
There is no witch here at the moment.	現在這裡沒有巫婆。
The wicked witch is not interested in chitchat.	這個邪惡的巫婆沒興趣閒聊。
It looks as though she's already caught YOU!	看樣子，她已經抓住你了！
Are you kidding?	你在開玩笑嗎？
There's no way you can do that.  The witch is holding you with supernatural strength.	你不可能辦到這件事，巫婆正用超自然的力量抓著你。
You're too high for that.  You'd break your neck.	你飛得太高了，這麼做會摔斷脖子。
The witch is mad enough already without you worsening her mood.	巫婆已經夠生氣了，別再讓她的心情更糟。
With a screech and cackle, a witch swoops down from the skies above.  Look out!  She dips and turns and tries to catch you!	伴隨著尖嘯與狂笑，一個巫婆從天而降。小心！她俯衝迴旋，想要抓住你！
It's a good thing you're invisible!	幸好你是隱形的！
She's got you!  She grabs you by the neck with an iron grip, and carries you off to her cottage deep in the forest.	她抓到你了！她用鐵一般的力道扣住你的脖子，把你帶往她深藏在森林裡的小屋。
The opening to the cave is dark and ominous.	洞穴的入口幽暗又不祥。
You vaguely see the outline of a cave entrance.	你隱約看見一個洞穴入口的輪廓。
A large cave is at the edge of this meadow.	這片草地的邊緣有個大洞穴。
This is a large condor.  Its graceful flight appears effortless.  At times, it dives so low you can practically touch it!	這是一隻巨大的兀鷲，牠飛行的姿態優雅、毫不費力。有時牠俯衝得很低，低到你幾乎可以摸到牠！
There is no bird here.	這裡沒有鳥。
You could try getting it, if you could only reach it.	要是你能搆得到，或許可以試著抓住牠。
The condor is out of your reach.	這隻兀鷲你搆不到。
These rocks are a little too treacherous to climb.	這些岩石有點太危險了，不好攀爬。
The bird is too high to kill.  Besides, why would you want to kill such a fine, friendly bird?	這隻鳥飛得太高，殺不到。而且，你為什麼要殺這麼一隻優秀又友善的鳥呢？
The condor doesn't speak, but it's wiser than you probably suspect.	這隻兀鷲不會說話，但牠恐怕比你想像的更有智慧。
The goat begins to reply, but then remembers that goats can't talk!	山羊正想開口回答，卻猛然想起山羊根本不會說話！
As there's nobody here to speak to, the conversation quickly grinds to a halt.	這裡沒有人可以交談，對話很快就冷場了。
The surrounding boulders and trees are reflected on the small, mirror-like lake.	周圍的巨石與樹木，倒映在這面如鏡的小湖上。
The fish is simply trying to get a good look at you.	這條魚只是想好好看看你。
Looks like all the fish have taken a dive.	看來所有的魚都已經潛入水中了。
There's nothing fishy about this quest; you won't be needing any of them.	這趟冒險跟魚一點關係也沒有，你用不到牠們。
There is a huge stalk growing here!	這裡長著一根巨大的莖幹！
You see a fragrant patch of clover growing in this lush meadow.	你看見這片茂盛的草地上，長著一片芬芳的三葉草叢。
Upon close examination, you see a four-leaf clover in the clover patch.	仔細一看，你在這片三葉草叢裡發現了一株幸運草。
You see a clover patch.	你看見一片三葉草叢。
A patch of clover catches your attention.	一片三葉草叢吸引了你的注意。
You won't need to pick any of those, but they're very pretty to look at.	你不需要摘這些，不過它們看起來很漂亮。
You've already picked the only four-leaf clover in the patch.	你已經摘走了這片草叢裡唯一的一株幸運草。
You can't pick any clover while you're invisible.	你隱形的時候沒辦法採摘三葉草。
